aracter-spine\"><div class=\"no-select\" style=\"position:absolute; bottom:-10px\"><img alt=\"Pifuxiaorendi 008.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ae/Pifuxiaorendi_008.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"240\" height=\"224\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"240\" data-file-height=\"224\" /></div><div><img alt=\"Spine static-304403 mosangnvshi.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/0/07/Spine_static-304403_mosangnvshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"356\" height=\"505\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"356\" data-file-height=\"505\" /></div></div></div></div><div class=\"character-infobox\" style=\"display:block\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3044\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8E%AB%E6%A1%91%E5%A5%B3%E5%A3%AB\" title=\"莫桑女士\"><img alt=\"Bgequip4.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/100px-Bgequip4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/150px-Bgequip4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Bgequip4.png/200px-Bgequip4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8E%AB%E6%A1%91%E5%A5%B3%E5%A3%AB\" title=\"莫桑女士\"><img alt=\"莫桑女士\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/HeadIconSmall-304401.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-304401.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/HeadIconSmall-304401.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8E%AB%E6%A1%91%E5%A5%B3%E5%A3%AB\" title=\"莫桑女士\">莫桑女士</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.7</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>咏叹的瞬间</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：304403</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">教堂的门在她身后轻轻关上。<br />《修女安吉莉卡》中的欧丝蜜娜违反了修道院的规矩，所以被赶出了教堂。<br />欧丝蜜娜不知道该往哪儿去，低头沿着石阶往下走。<br />然后她闻到了花香。<br />抬起头，花园就在眼前。不同于肃穆的教堂，花园中开满了红色的玫瑰。阳光斜照，蜜蜂“嗡嗡”地钻进钻出，翅膀上沾着金粉。花瓣落在草地上，厚厚一层。<br />风吹过来，几片花瓣落在她肩头。<br />神将它们拒之门外，但玫瑰并不在意，依旧怒放。<br />她在花园里站了很久，直到夕阳把影子拉长。她没有念祷告词，只是扶着石墙，看着那些花。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"304403\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304404.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/5b/Belonging-304404.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">Ruby南洋白珠项链<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Ruby\" Pearl Necklace</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"雨滴\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Value-1.png/27px-Value-1.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"雨滴\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Value-1.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />9000<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>来自佩戴者的学生。某位年轻的小姐非常诚恳地将这条项链作为“成人礼”赠予了自己的老师。<br />尽管其中误会颇多。但不可否认的是，这条项链完美地衬托出了佩戴者的优雅气质。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304405.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f6/Belonging-304405.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“祈愿的时刻”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"A Moment of Prayer\"</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />500<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>由内外两层丝绸制成的修女头巾，尽管已采用了比较轻便的布料，但由于其面积不小，戴久了仍会使人感到颈部酸痛。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-304406.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a3/Belonging-304406.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“悔过的泪水”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Repentant Tears\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>使用神秘术制作出来的小陶瓷贴片。这枚可爱的小东西被贴在了颧骨处，完美地契合了舞台的主题。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%961.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 教堂之外1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%961.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%961.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%961.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%961.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%961.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%961.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%962.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 教堂之外2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%962.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%962.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%962.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%962.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/91/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%962.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%962.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">教堂之外 <small style=\"color: grey\">Outside the Church</small></span></span>"}}